***REMOVED*** Using Android gitignore template: https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/HEAD/Android.gitignore

***REMOVED*** Built application files
*.apk
*.aar
*.ap_
*.aab

***REMOVED*** Files for the ART/Dalvik VM
*.dex

***REMOVED*** Java class files
*.class

***REMOVED*** Generated files
bin/
gen/
out/
***REMOVED***  Uncomment the following line in case you need and you don't have the release build type files in your app
***REMOVED*** release/

***REMOVED*** Gradle files
.gradle/
build/

***REMOVED*** Local configuration file (sdk path, etc)
local.properties

***REMOVED*** Proguard folder generated by Eclipse
proguard/

***REMOVED*** Log Files
*.log

***REMOVED*** Android Studio Navigation editor temp files
.navigation/

***REMOVED*** Android Studio captures folder
captures/

***REMOVED*** IntelliJ
*.iml
.idea/workspace.xml
.idea/tasks.xml
.idea/gradle.xml
.idea/assetWizardSettings.xml
.idea/dictionaries
.idea/libraries
***REMOVED*** Android Studio 3 in .gitignore file.
.idea/caches
.idea/modules.xml
***REMOVED*** Comment next line if keeping position of elements in Navigation Editor is relevant for you
.idea/navEditor.xml

***REMOVED*** Keystore files
***REMOVED*** Uncomment the following lines if you do not want to check your keystore files in.
***REMOVED****.jks
***REMOVED****.keystore

***REMOVED*** External native build folder generated in Android Studio 2.2 and later
.externalNativeBuild
.cxx/

***REMOVED*** Google Services (e.g. APIs or Firebase)
***REMOVED*** google-services.json

***REMOVED*** Freeline
freeline.py
freeline/
freeline_project_description.json

***REMOVED*** fastlane
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/Preview.html
fastlane/screenshots
fastlane/test_output
fastlane/readme.md

***REMOVED*** Version control
vcs.xml

***REMOVED*** lint
lint/intermediates/
lint/generated/
lint/outputs/
lint/tmp/
***REMOVED*** lint/reports/

***REMOVED*** Android Profiling
*.hprof

***REMOVED*** Cordova plugins for Capacitor
capacitor-cordova-android-plugins

***REMOVED*** Copied web assets
app/src/main/assets/public

***REMOVED*** Generated Config files
app/src/main/assets/capacitor.config.json
app/src/main/assets/capacitor.plugins.json
app/src/main/res/xml/config.xml
